+| # | Title | Axis | Effect | Severity | Origin | Verdict | Action | Batch |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | the README does not show `--from` | the CLI's contract | misleading | low | new | CONFIRMED | fix | 2 |
+| 2 | no test installs the release the gateway already runs | tests | misleading | low | new | CONFIRMED | fix | 1 |
+| 3 | an archive given as a symbolic link is copied from its target | security | wrong action | low | new | REFUTED | rejected | — |
