+## Findings
+
+### 1. the README does not show `--from`
+
+```
+FINDING
+axis: the CLI's contract
+severity: low
+where: src/presentation/cli.rs:128 (GatewayAction::Install), README.md:147 (gateway)
+title: the README does not show `--from`
+cause: docs/commands.md alone was changed, though the phase's last task says both
+effect: misleading
+consequence: the walk-through gives no way to install without the network
+fix: the option in the README's gateway section
+test: none: a document
+evidence: read: the README and the phase file's task
+```
+
+Reviewers: review-structure. Origin: new. Floor: above. Fingerprint: `the CLI's contract | README.md + src/presentation/cli.rs | GatewayAction::Install + gateway`.
+Verdict: CONFIRMED. Action: fix, batch 2.
+
+### 2. no test installs the release the gateway already runs
+
+```
+FINDING
+axis: tests
+severity: low
+where: src/application/gateway.rs:143 (Installer::install)
+title: no test installs the release the gateway already runs
+cause: the warning's test has the gateway run the previous release only
+effect: misleading
+consequence: a warning given when the gateway runs the new release would pass every test
+fix: a test where the gateway runs the release installed, with no warning
+test: an_install_warns_of_nothing_when_the_gateway_runs_the_new_release
+evidence: cargo mutants --in-diff: `replace match guard running != release with true in Installer<'_>::install` missed
+```
+
+Reviewers: review-tests. Origin: new. Floor: above. Fingerprint: `tests | src/application/gateway.rs | Installer::install`.
+Verdict: CONFIRMED. Action: fix, batch 1.
+
+### 3. an archive given as a symbolic link is copied from its target
+
+```
+FINDING
+axis: security
+severity: low
+where: src/infrastructure/gateway_store.rs:114 (FsGatewayStore::stage_from)
+title: an archive given as a symbolic link is copied from its target
+cause: stage_from copies `--from`'s path with fs::copy, which follows a link
+effect: wrong action
+consequence: `--from` naming a link installs the file it points at
+fix: the link refused
+test: none: settled by the verification
+evidence: read: stage_from
+```
+
+Reviewers: review-security. Origin: new. Floor: above. Fingerprint: `security | src/infrastructure/gateway_store.rs | FsGatewayStore::stage_from`.
+Verdict: REFUTED. Action: rejected. the path is the user's own argument, and the archive is checked against its digest after the copy: no boundary is crossed.
